                <mxCell id="d-cmp" value="Ordering: b2 &lt; b7 lexicographically, so v-b2 comes first -&#xa;even though v-b7 finished first (seq 18 &lt; seq 21).&#xa;Sorting by seq would emit 3. before 2. on this run and&#xa;possibly 2. before 3. on the next, for identical business facts." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFEC99;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=LXGW WenKai TC;strokeColor=#F08C00;fontColor=#F08C00;" parent="1" vertex="1">
